          "author": "Isabel Quintero",
          "description": "When Daisy Ramona zooms around her neighborhood with her papi on his motorcycle, she sees the people and places she’s always known. She also sees a community that is rapidly changing around her.    But as the sun sets purple-blue-gold behind Daisy Ramona and her papi, she knows that the love she feels will always be there. \n\nMy Papi Has a Motorcycle is a young girl’s love letter to her hardworking dad and to memories of home that we hold close in the midst of change.",
